  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original608 whole living porolepiform with broad flattened predatory head and rounded overlapping scales, not a scale-only or fossil-slab study. [\"Published Fig1A is genus reconstruction after Jarvik1980, not a photograph of an intact specimen.\", \"H.jarviki supplies scale pattern, while other labeled species specimens corroborate genus scales only. Do not claim one exact individual or silent mixed-species scan.\", \"Color, soft lip form, body thickness and pose are original reconstruction choices.\", \"Eye and tooth fine counts not established, avoid numerical anatomy claims.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"total_length_m\": 0.9, \"status\": \"Illustrative whole-animal size, not a measured length of any pictured specimen. Fossil scales in primary2020Fig1 are calibrated by10mm bars;2007 NBMG13038 scales about2cm diameter.\", \"body_width_m\": 0.14, \"body_height_m\": 0.16, \"scale_diameter_m\": 0.02, \"uncertainty\": \"Do not claim reconstructed body length measured from isolated scales. Total size, cross-section and palette are artistic assumptions; anatomical proportions follow published genus reconstruction.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original608 whole living porolepiform with broad flattened predatory head and rounded overlapping scales, not a scale-only or fossil-slab study. [\"Published Fig1A is genus reconstruction after Jarvik1980, not a photograph of an intact specimen.\", \"H.jarviki supplies scale pattern, while other labeled species specimens corroborate genus scales only. Do not claim one exact individual or silent mixed-species scan.\", \"Color, soft lip form, body thickness and pose are original reconstruction choices.\", \"Eye and tooth fine counts not established, avoid numerical anatomy claims.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"total_length_m\": 0.9, \"status\": \"Illustrative whole-animal size, not a measured length of any pictured specimen. Fossil scales in primary2020Fig1 are calibrated by10mm bars;2007 NBMG13038 scales about2cm diameter.\", \"body_width_m\": 0.14, \"body_height_m\": 0.16, \"scale_diameter_m\": 0.02, \"uncertainty\": \"Do not claim reconstructed body length measured from isolated scales. Total size, cross-section and palette are artistic assumptions; anatomical proportions follow published genus reconstruction.\"}"
  },
